---

---

<footer class="border-t border-[var(--border)]">
    <details class="group">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[var(--muted)] marker:hidden md:px-5">
            <span>License and source</span>
            <span class="grid size-8 place-items-center border border-[var(--border)] font-serif text-sm tracking-normal text-[var(--text)] group-open:hidden">
                CC
            </span>
            <span class="hidden size-8 place-items-center border border-[var(--border)] font-serif text-sm tracking-normal text-[var(--text)] group-open:grid">
                ×
            </span>
        </summary>

        <div class="grid border-t border-[var(--border)] md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
            <section class="border-b border-[var(--border)] p-4 md:border-r md:p-5 xl:border-b-0">
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[var(--muted)] md:mb-3">
                    Source
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs leading-6 text-[var(--muted)] md:text-sm md:leading-7">
                    The source for this blog is public. If you spot a problem with either the content or code,
                    please open a&nbsp;
                    <a
                        href="https://github.com/al-jibran/jibran/issues"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="text-[var(--text)] underline decoration-[var(--border)] underline-offset-4 hover:italic"
                        >GitHub issue</a
                    >.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="border-b border-[var(--border)] p-4 md:p-5 xl:border-b-0 xl:border-r">
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[var(--muted)] md:mb-3">
                    Writing
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs leading-6 text-[var(--muted)] md:text-sm md:leading-7">
                    Unless noted otherwise, original work on this blog is available
                    under CC BY 4.0 with attribution.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="border-b border-[var(--border)] p-4 md:border-r md:border-b-0 md:p-5">
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[var(--muted)] md:mb-3">
                    Code
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs leading-6 text-[var(--muted)] md:text-sm md:leading-7">
                    Original code snippets in posts are available under the MIT
                    License, unless noted otherwise.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="p-4 md:p-5">
                <h2 class="mb-2 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[var(--muted)] md:mb-3">
                    References
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs leading-6 text-[var(--muted)] md:text-sm md:leading-7">
                    Third-party assets, references, and quoted work remain under
                    their original terms.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </details>
</footer>
